{"seq":1,"slug":"tracking-fundamentals","title":"埋点基础：事件模型、属性设计、埋点分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/event-tracking-design/tracking-fundamentals","wordCount":1441,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"埋点基础-事件模型-属性设计-埋点分类\">埋点基础：事件模型、属性设计、埋点分类</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>事件模型</strong>：将用户的每一个行为抽象为一个事件，由事件名称、事件属性、用户属性和时间戳组成</li>\n<li><strong>事件分类</strong>：页面事件、交互事件、业务事件、系统事件、曝光事件，各自的数据量与分析价值不同</li>\n<li><strong>属性设计原则</strong>：原子性、可枚举、正交性、稳定性、可空性，避免过度采集</li>\n<li><strong>三种埋点方式</strong>：全埋点（覆盖广但缺语义）、手动埋点（精确但成本高）、可视化埋点（非开发可操作但稳定性差）</li>\n<li><strong>混合埋点策略</strong>：页面浏览用全埋点、核心业务事件用手动埋点、运营活动用可视化埋点</li>\n<li><strong>用户标识体系</strong>：通过 ID Mapping 将匿名 ID、登录 ID、设备 ID 关联为统一 ID，实现跨端用户统一</li>\n<li><strong>会话切割</strong>：通常基于 30 分钟事件间隔规则，是用户行为分析的基本分析单元</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"什么是埋点\">什么是埋点</h2><p>埋点是在应用程序中植入数据采集代码，记录用户行为和系统状态的技术手段。埋点采集的数据是整个数据分析链路的源头，数据质量的上限在埋点设计阶段就已经确定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户行为] --&gt; B[埋点采集]&#10;    B --&gt; C[数据传输]&#10;    C --&gt; D[数据存储]&#10;    D --&gt; E[数据分析]&#10;    E --&gt; F[业务决策]&#10;    B --&gt; G[数据质量在此决定]\">graph LR\n    A[用户行为] --&gt; B[埋点采集]\n    B --&gt; C[数据传输]\n    C --&gt; D[数据存储]\n    D --&gt; E[数据分析]\n    E --&gt; F[业务决策]\n    B --&gt; G[数据质量在此决定]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件模型\">事件模型</h2><h3 id=\"事件的基本结构\">事件的基本结构</h3><p>现代数据采集普遍采用事件模型（Event Model），将用户的每一个行为抽象为一个事件。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件名称</td>\n<td>唯一标识一类行为</td>\n<td>page_view、button_click</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件属性</td>\n<td>描述该事件的上下文信息</td>\n<td>page_name、button_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户属性</td>\n<td>触发事件的用户信息</td>\n<td>user_id、device_type</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间戳</td>\n<td>事件发生的精确时间</td>\n<td>2025-03-15T10:30:00Z</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话 ID</td>\n<td>标识用户的一次访问</td>\n<td>session_abc123</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 典型的事件数据表结构&#10;CREATE TABLE events (&#10;    event_id        VARCHAR(64) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    event_name      VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,&#10;    event_time      TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,&#10;    user_id         VARCHAR(64),&#10;    anonymous_id    VARCHAR(64),&#10;    session_id      VARCHAR(64),&#10;    platform        VARCHAR(20),&#10;    app_version     VARCHAR(20),&#10;    properties      JSONB&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 典型的事件数据表结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_name      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_time      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    anonymous_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    session_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    platform        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    app_version     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    properties      JSONB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"事件分类\">事件分类</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[事件类型] --&gt; B[页面事件]&#10;    A --&gt; C[交互事件]&#10;    A --&gt; D[业务事件]&#10;    A --&gt; E[系统事件]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[页面浏览、页面停留]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[点击、滑动、输入]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[注册、下单、支付]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[崩溃、性能、错误]\">graph TD\n    A[事件类型] --&gt; B[页面事件]\n    A --&gt; C[交互事件]\n    A --&gt; D[业务事件]\n    A --&gt; E[系统事件]\n    B --&gt; B1[页面浏览、页面停留]\n    C --&gt; C1[点击、滑动、输入]\n    D --&gt; D1[注册、下单、支付]\n    E --&gt; E1[崩溃、性能、错误]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件类型</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>数据量</th>\n<th>分析价值</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>页面事件</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>page_view、page_leave</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互事件</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>button_click、form_submit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务事件</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>purchase、register</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统事件</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>运维</td>\n<td>crash、api_error</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曝光事件</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>item_exposure</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"属性设计\">属性设计</h2><h3 id=\"属性分类\">属性分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性类型</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件属性</td>\n<td>描述单次事件的上下文</td>\n<td>page_name、product_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户属性</td>\n<td>描述用户的固有特征</td>\n<td>age、gender、vip_level</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超级属性</td>\n<td>自动附加到所有事件</td>\n<td>app_version、platform</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预置属性</td>\n<td>SDK 自动采集</td>\n<td>device_model、os_version</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义属性</td>\n<td>业务自行定义</td>\n<td>referrer_campaign、ab_test_group</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"属性数据类型\">属性数据类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td>分类标签、ID</td>\n<td>控制枚举值范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字</td>\n<td>金额、数量、时长</td>\n<td>明确单位（元/分、秒/毫秒）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布尔值</td>\n<td>是/否状态</td>\n<td>避免用字符串表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期时间</td>\n<td>时间相关属性</td>\n<td>统一时区（建议 UTC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数组</td>\n<td>标签列表、多选值</td>\n<td>控制数组长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象</td>\n<td>复杂嵌套属性</td>\n<td>避免过深嵌套</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"属性设计原则\">属性设计原则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原子性</td>\n<td>每个属性只描述一个信息维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可枚举</td>\n<td>字符串属性的取值范围应可枚举</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正交性</td>\n<td>属性之间不应有冗余或推导关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>属性名称和含义一旦发布不应随意变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可空性</td>\n<td>明确定义哪些属性必填、哪些可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不过度采集</td>\n<td>只采集有分析价值的属性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 好的属性设计&#10;-- event: add_to_cart&#10;-- properties: {&#10;--   &quot;product_id&quot;: &quot;P12345&quot;,&#10;--   &quot;product_name&quot;: &quot;无线耳机&quot;,&#10;--   &quot;product_category&quot;: &quot;数码&quot;,&#10;--   &quot;price&quot;: 299.00,&#10;--   &quot;quantity&quot;: 1,&#10;--   &quot;source_page&quot;: &quot;product_detail&quot;&#10;-- }&#10;&#10;-- 差的属性设计&#10;-- event: add_to_cart&#10;-- properties: {&#10;--   &quot;info&quot;: &quot;P12345-无线耳机-数码-299-1&quot;,  -- 违反原子性&#10;--   &quot;price_str&quot;: &quot;¥299.00&quot;,                 -- 混合了格式信息&#10;--   &quot;is_vip&quot;: &quot;yes&quot;,                        -- 应该用布尔值&#10;--   &quot;timestamp&quot;: &quot;2025-03-15&quot;               -- 与事件时间冗余&#10;-- }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 好的属性设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- event: add_to_cart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- properties: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"product_id\": \"P12345\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"product_name\": \"无线耳机\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"product_category\": \"数码\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"price\": 299.00,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"quantity\": 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"source_page\": \"product_detail\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 差的属性设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- event: add_to_cart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- properties: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"info\": \"P12345-无线耳机-数码-299-1\",  -- 违反原子性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"price_str\": \"¥299.00\",                 -- 混合了格式信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"is_vip\": \"yes\",                        -- 应该用布尔值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   \"timestamp\": \"2025-03-15\"               -- 与事件时间冗余</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- }</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"埋点分类\">埋点分类</h2><h3 id=\"三种埋点方式\">三种埋点方式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[埋点方式] --&gt; B[全埋点]&#10;    A --&gt; C[手动埋点]&#10;    A --&gt; D[可视化埋点]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[自动采集所有交互]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[数据量大,粒度粗]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[开发者手动编码]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[数据精确,成本高]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[可视化界面配置]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[运营可自助,灵活性中]\">graph TD\n    A[埋点方式] --&gt; B[全埋点]\n    A --&gt; C[手动埋点]\n    A --&gt; D[可视化埋点]\n    B --&gt; B1[自动采集所有交互]\n    B --&gt; B2[数据量大,粒度粗]\n    C --&gt; C1[开发者手动编码]\n    C --&gt; C2[数据精确,成本高]\n    D --&gt; D1[可视化界面配置]\n    D --&gt; D2[运营可自助,灵活性中]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>埋点方式</th>\n<th>实现原理</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全埋点</td>\n<td>劫持 DOM 事件/路由</td>\n<td>零开发成本，覆盖全面</td>\n<td>数据量大，缺乏业务语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动埋点</td>\n<td>在代码中显式调用 SDK</td>\n<td>数据精确，语义丰富</td>\n<td>开发成本高，迭代需发版</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化埋点</td>\n<td>通过圈选工具选定元素</td>\n<td>非开发人员可操作</td>\n<td>依赖页面结构，稳定性差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"全埋点\">全埋点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 全埋点自动采集的数据示例&#10;SELECT&#10;    event_name,       -- $pageview, $click, $input 等预定义事件&#10;    element_id,       -- 被交互元素的 ID&#10;    element_type,     -- button, link, input 等&#10;    element_content,  -- 元素的文本内容&#10;    page_url,         -- 当前页面 URL&#10;    event_time&#10;FROM auto_track_events&#10;WHERE user_id = &#39;U12345&#39;&#10;ORDER BY event_time;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 全埋点自动采集的数据示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_name,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- $pageview, $click, $input 等预定义事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    element_id,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 被交互元素的 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    element_type,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- button, link, input 等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    element_content,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 元素的文本内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    page_url,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 当前页面 URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auto_track_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'U12345'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"手动埋点\">手动埋点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 手动埋点的数据更具业务语义&#10;SELECT&#10;    event_name,       -- add_to_cart（精确的业务事件名）&#10;    properties-&gt;&gt;&#39;product_id&#39; AS product_id,&#10;    (properties-&gt;&gt;&#39;price&#39;)::DECIMAL AS price,&#10;    (properties-&gt;&gt;&#39;quantity&#39;)::INT AS quantity,&#10;    properties-&gt;&gt;&#39;source_page&#39; AS source_page,&#10;    event_time&#10;FROM manual_track_events&#10;WHERE user_id = &#39;U12345&#39;&#10;ORDER BY event_time;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 手动埋点的数据更具业务语义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_name,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- add_to_cart（精确的业务事件名）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    properties</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product_id'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (properties</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'price'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (properties</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quantity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quantity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    properties</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'source_page'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source_page,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> manual_track_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'U12345'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"混合埋点策略\">混合埋点策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件类型</th>\n<th>推荐埋点方式</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>页面浏览</td>\n<td>全埋点</td>\n<td>标准事件，自动采集即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通用交互（点击）</td>\n<td>全埋点</td>\n<td>覆盖面广，回溯分析有价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心业务事件</td>\n<td>手动埋点</td>\n<td>需要精确的业务属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运营活动事件</td>\n<td>可视化埋点</td>\n<td>频繁变更，运营可自助配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常和性能</td>\n<td>自动采集</td>\n<td>与错误监控系统集成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"用户标识体系\">用户标识体系</h2><h3 id=\"用户-id-方案\">用户 ID 方案</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户标识] --&gt; B[匿名 ID]&#10;    A --&gt; C[登录 ID]&#10;    A --&gt; D[设备 ID]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Cookie/LocalStorage]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[注册账号 ID]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[IDFA/Android ID]\">graph TD\n    A[用户标识] --&gt; B[匿名 ID]\n    A --&gt; C[登录 ID]\n    A --&gt; D[设备 ID]\n    B --&gt; B1[Cookie/LocalStorage]\n    C --&gt; C1[注册账号 ID]\n    D --&gt; D1[IDFA/Android ID]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ID 类型</th>\n<th>生成方式</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>跨设备</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>匿名 ID</td>\n<td>SDK 自动生成 UUID</td>\n<td>浏览器/设备级</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>未登录用户追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>登录 ID</td>\n<td>用户注册生成</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>已登录用户追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备 ID</td>\n<td>系统级标识</td>\n<td>设备级</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>App 端用户追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一 ID</td>\n<td>ID Mapping 关联</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>跨端用户统一</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"id-关联-id-mapping\">ID 关联（ID Mapping）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- ID Mapping 表&#10;CREATE TABLE id_mapping (&#10;    unified_id    VARCHAR(64),&#10;    id_type       VARCHAR(20),&#10;    id_value      VARCHAR(64),&#10;    first_seen_at TIMESTAMP,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (id_type, id_value)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 查询某个用户的所有关联 ID&#10;SELECT * FROM id_mapping WHERE unified_id = &#39;U_unified_001&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 通过任意 ID 查找统一 ID&#10;SELECT unified_id FROM id_mapping&#10;WHERE id_type = &#39;anonymous&#39; AND id_value = &#39;anon_abc123&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ID Mapping 表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id_mapping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    unified_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id_type       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id_value      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    first_seen_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (id_type, id_value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询某个用户的所有关联 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id_mapping </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unified_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'U_unified_001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 通过任意 ID 查找统一 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unified_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id_mapping</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'anonymous'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'anon_abc123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"会话-session-设计\">会话（Session）设计</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>会话切割规则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间间隔</td>\n<td>两次事件间隔超过 30 分钟则切割新会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨天切割</td>\n<td>跨自然日时切割新会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>来源变化</td>\n<td>用户来源渠道变化时切割新会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前后台切换</td>\n<td>App 从后台恢复时切割新会话</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 基于时间间隔的会话切割&#10;WITH event_gaps AS (&#10;    SELECT&#10;        user_id,&#10;        event_time,&#10;        LAG(event_time) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY event_time) AS prev_event_time,&#10;        CASE&#10;            WHEN event_time - LAG(event_time) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY event_time) &gt; INTERVAL &#39;30 minutes&#39;&#10;            THEN 1&#10;            ELSE 0&#10;        END AS is_new_session&#10;    FROM events&#10;),&#10;session_ids AS (&#10;    SELECT&#10;        user_id,&#10;        event_time,&#10;        SUM(is_new_session) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY event_time) AS session_number&#10;    FROM event_gaps&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;    user_id,&#10;    session_number,&#10;    MIN(event_time) AS session_start,&#10;    MAX(event_time) AS session_end,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS event_count,&#10;    MAX(event_time) - MIN(event_time) AS session_duration&#10;FROM session_ids&#10;GROUP BY user_id, session_number;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 基于时间间隔的会话切割</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_gaps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        event_time,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev_event_time,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 minutes'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_new_session</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">session_ids </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        event_time,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(is_new_session) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_gaps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    session_number,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_start,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_end,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_duration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_ids</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id, session_number;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>事件模型是现代数据采集的标准范式，每个事件由事件名称、事件属性、用户属性和时间戳组成</li>\n<li>属性设计应遵循原子性、可枚举、正交性和稳定性原则，避免过度采集</li>\n<li>全埋点覆盖广但缺乏业务语义，手动埋点精确但成本高，混合策略是最佳实践</li>\n<li>用户标识需要建立匿名 ID 到登录 ID 的关联机制（ID Mapping）实现跨端统一</li>\n<li>会话切割通常基于 30 分钟的事件间隔规则，是用户行为分析的基本分析单元</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"埋点基础：事件模型、属性设计、埋点分类","id":"埋点基础-事件模型-属性设计-埋点分类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是埋点","id":"什么是埋点"},{"level":2,"text":"事件模型","id":"事件模型"},{"level":3,"text":"事件的基本结构","id":"事件的基本结构"},{"level":3,"text":"事件分类","id":"事件分类"},{"level":2,"text":"属性设计","id":"属性设计"},{"level":3,"text":"属性分类","id":"属性分类"},{"level":3,"text":"属性数据类型","id":"属性数据类型"},{"level":3,"text":"属性设计原则","id":"属性设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"埋点分类","id":"埋点分类"},{"level":3,"text":"三种埋点方式","id":"三种埋点方式"},{"level":3,"text":"全埋点","id":"全埋点"},{"level":3,"text":"手动埋点","id":"手动埋点"},{"level":3,"text":"混合埋点策略","id":"混合埋点策略"},{"level":2,"text":"用户标识体系","id":"用户标识体系"},{"level":3,"text":"用户 ID 方案","id":"用户-id-方案"},{"level":3,"text":"ID 关联（ID Mapping）","id":"id-关联-id-mapping"},{"level":2,"text":"会话（Session）设计","id":"会话-session-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可视化工具：D3.js / ECharts / Grafana / Metabase / Superset 对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-visualization/visualization-tools"},"next":{"title":"埋点方案设计：埋点文档规范、命名规范、Review 流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/event-tracking-design/tracking-plan"}}